# Cinnabar Island (FireRed's MUS_CINNABAR, which the island, its lab and its Mart share): a sunny, easy-going tune in
# B-flat over a gentle swing, a marimba lead and a muted guitar's off-beat chords above a walking bass, for the
# volcanic island of the lab at the end of the sea routes. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K6, part b).
